  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.8 - align user status model with the Guardhouse API lifecycle contract.\n\n            Changes:\n            - BREAKING: UserStatus now contains only Guardhouse lifecycle statuses: Staged, Invited, Active, Archived\n            - BREAKING: Removed SDK-only Inactive, Locked, and Suspended user status values\n            - Fixed numeric status deserialization so server status 2 maps to Invited, 3 maps to Active, and 4 maps to Archived\n            - Added IsSuspended and IsLocked to GetUserByIdResponse so access flags are represented separately from lifecycle status",
